{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally in Russia", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Historical Stroll", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing About History and The<span class=\"italic\"> Simple Past</span> Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Writing about history requires you to include a lot of details and historical information. Writing about history shows your writing skills and your understanding of information.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol> <li>Research information about a topic. Use more than one source.</li> <li>Stay on topic. When you write about history, include events and issues, not descriptions.</li> <li>Include the important details.</li> <li>Do not include your opinion. The paragraph is on history not your opinion of it.</li> <li>Write in chronological order.</li> <li>Write in the past tense.</li> </ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about history, you usually use the <span class=\"italic\">Simple Past </span> tense because you are talking about things in general and/or facts in the past.<br> When you write about the past you can both regular and irregular past tense verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Verbs with a regular past tense:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Base Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Past Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"promise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"promised\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"order\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ordered\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"believe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"believed\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Verbs with an irregular past tense:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Base Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Past Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"come\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"came\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am/is/are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"make\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"made\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grow\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grew\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Overall, they believed that under communist leadership, the lives of the Russian people would be easier.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "In November 1917, a communist government came to power in Russia.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Lenin was very popular with workers.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "communist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who believes in communism or is a member of a political party that supports communism", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Communist Party came to power in 1917.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to write a paragraph about events in history.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "slogan", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a word or phrase that is easy to remember and is used by a group to attract attention", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Lenin's slogans were popular with workers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "legitimate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "real, accepted, or official", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They believed Lenin was the legitimate leader of the workers in the Soviet Union.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "peasant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a poor farmer or farm worker", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He also said he would give land to the peasants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Soviet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "person from the former USSR", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He ordered that Soviets and workers would control the factories.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "factory", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a building or group of buildings where products are made", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a factory in that small town.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "outsider", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who does not belong to or is not accepted into a particular group or organization", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The support for Lenin grew in a country that had been controlled by tsars and outsiders.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research an interesting festival or cultural celebration.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the Past Simple tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner or family member.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research festivals and cultural celebrations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Simple Past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can write a small paragraph.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk or report about things, actions and events. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write about history.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you know anything about Russian history? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you know who Lenin was and why he was very important in Russia and all over the world?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "